{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33821","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 笭箵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 笭箵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝空笭箵去，暮实笭箵归。\n归来倒却鱼，挂在幽窗扉。\n但闻鰕蚬气，欲生苹藻衣。\n十年佩此处，烟雨苦霏霏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}